		line=645,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The first thing I notice upon awaking is a dull pain in my head.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"What a terrible dream that was.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"I never expected Mitsurugi would go through with killing Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Suddenly, I notice the streaks of liquid trailing down my cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Are these my tears?",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Beside me, a girl lets out a groan as she unsteadily picks herself up.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Is that you, Akari?",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Or are you...",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“...Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I'm Tokita Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Her face scrunches up and her lips quiver.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm... Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry... I'm Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Her words finally make me realize.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The dream I just saw was reality.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, this is...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Akari holds up two broken halves of a magatama.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then with my own two hands... I killed...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It wasn't just you.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm just as responsible for killing the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Neither of us could hold back our feelings.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"The weight of my regrets crashes into me.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"...How could I?",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"How could I have done such a thing?",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I go on and on about being a tool, and yet I─!”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How disgraceful.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Disgraceful is right.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Slumping her shoulders, Akari lets out a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Can I be pathetic for a second?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Akari bites down on her lip before continuing.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even in a situation like this, all I can think about is how happy I am to see you again.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know I shouldn't be, but I'm just so, so happy.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Me too.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nnh?!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"My face is suddenly wrapped in softness.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Akari is hugging my head against her chest.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"I breathe in a deep lungful of her scent.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"The familiar, comforting smell reminds me she's safe and fills me with relief and joy.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"My guilt towards Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi still hangs heavily over me.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"But no matter how much I blame myself, I cannot lie about my true feelings.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"─I'm in love with Akari.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How weak the two of us are.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah. We can't even compare to those two.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Just as Mitsurugi said, the two of us failed even to relinquish our lives.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Despite vowing to lay down our lives for the Empire, we disgraced ourselves by refusing to forswear our love.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"And in doing so, forced the hands of two who were far more courageous than us.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"We cannot be forgiven for our weakness.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"We can only hope to atone by vanquishing Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We... We can only do what we must.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Akari stares at the two halves of the magatama in her palm.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, we shall atone for our indiscretion by striking Kahaku down.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“May you bear witness to our fate.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Akari closes her eyes and murmurs a quiet prayer.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Suddenly, the broken magatama shimmers with a faint light.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Right before our wide eyes, it dissolves into Akari's chest and vanishes.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, will you really accompany us?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Akari's eyes are aglow with an alacrity that never was there previously.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Their color has not changed, but there is a definite difference about them all the same.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"It is as though her boundless resolve and vigor are flowing into me through her amaranthine gaze.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"These are the same magicks I always felt from Himi-no-Mikoto when I stood beside her as Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It looks like Himi-no-Mikoto's power is well and truly within you.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You can tell?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My body's felt different ever since I woke up.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's like I've grown a third eye, like I can see the flow of magicks all around me.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I bet if I do this, I can make the wind...”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Akari waves her arm.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoa?!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"A sudden gust of wind smacks me in the face.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?! No way!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I just... used magicks?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"She stares at her hands with amazement.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think you can draw out my power?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“According to Himi-no-Mikoto, there's still a part of it locked away inside me.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Akari trails off, looking curiously at me.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's no need to rush with that.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When the battle is upon us, you'll awaken to it on your own.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"If my lord says so, I'll not question it further.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyway, it's about time to head back to the real world.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The scenery around us immediately melts away, as if responding to Akari's words.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"We find ourselves right outside the Shireiden.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The transient world of the past is no more as we emerge in the real one.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How is Tenkyo faring?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If what Himi-no-Mikoto said is true, everyone should have come back to their senses.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course, that includes the Republican soldiers guarding the palace.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where could Kahaku be right now?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Has he taken Rochel's form, or has he yet to revive himself?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go find out.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Ngh.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Akari stumbles as she tries to take a step forward, and I grab her hand to support her.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Her hand is warm and slick with sweat.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're burning up.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm fine. Just a little tired.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should rest for a while. Himi-no-Mikoto said Kahaku\nwouldn't be revived until tomorrow at the earliest.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should be in our best condition when we take him on again.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, you've got a point.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I take Akari up in my arms, just like when we first arrived at the Shireiden.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wai─what do you think you're doing?!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's find somewhere we can rest.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Leaping across the rooftops, we arrive at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Just as Akari said, the chaos across the city has already died down.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Still, the damages are vast.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"All around us, people are crowded helplessly around injured victims and the burned-out husks of buildings.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Had the carnage continued for just another hour, there might be nothing left of Tenkyo but rubble and ash.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Miyoshi's no good. Nobody's there.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you think Mutsumi-san and Koyuzu made it out all right?”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sure the manager handled things just fine.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"We arrive next at Koujiya Flowers, only to find the storefront boarded up tightly, seemingly not having been opened in some time.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nothing here, either...”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure the Republican Army's already searched the place. We should be glad it's even in one piece.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Looking up at the shop's signboard, the peaceful days I spent here flash through my mind.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Once our fight is over, I swear to see its shelves brightened with fresh flowers once more.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I suddenly spot an object conspicuously out of place along the dusty storefront.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"A single, fresh flower poking out from the slight gap between two shutters.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“An autumn bellflower. And it's still fresh.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So someone placed it there recently?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's that supposed to mean? And why a bellflower, of all things?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Bellflower... Bellflower...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin & Akari"},
			{
"“Operation Bellflower!” “Operation Bellflower!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"We stare at each other with wide eyes.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could someone be trying to send a message to us?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The people involved with Operation Bellflower were Kanami, Kotone, Hotori, Elsa... and Shino, too.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Among them, the only ones who could've put this here would be Elsa and Shino.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, are they telling us to head to the Government-General?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come on, that's insane. It's gotta be somewhere else.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Crawling with Republican soldiers.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Imperial Temple?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A pile of rubble.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"The Kurushima Group Headquarters would also be way too conspicuous.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Where else haven't we thought of?",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The student council office!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could be.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go check it out.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"I pluck the bellflower from between the shutters before taking Akari into my arms again.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Soaring across the roof, we land in the courtyard and enter the school building.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Not only is the school completely deserted, it seems to have been abandoned a long time ago.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Still, I remain on my guard as I cautiously pry open the door to the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"The office, too, is deserted.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"However, it's been filled floor-to-ceiling with all manner of supplies.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Rations, water, firearms, ammunition, and spellblades─",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"It's every bit as well-provisioned as a field command center.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, look here.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"One of the piled-up boxes has a handwritten note taped to its side.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“'I trust the industrious members of our student council will put these supplies to good use and deliver us a bright\nfuture!'”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“'Eat some meat, ya bums!'”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“'xoxo, Shino ☆彡'”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There you have it.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"were",
{"/font"},
" technically on the student council, weren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We sure were, Public Relations Officer Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shino must have prepared all this for us.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"There are even several clean cots laid out in the back.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"It's the perfect location for us to get some rest.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"We pack up enough supplies to be ready to leave at a\nmoment's notice before catching some well-needed sleep.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
